# SuperTuxKart's profile race, its benchmark: four AI karts drive two laps of
# the lighthouse track at intermediate difficulty from a fixed random seed,
# and the game ends itself at the race's end with its profile summary, which
# the verbose log level prints. Blank-separated words, read by games.sh.
--profile-laps=2
--track=lighthouse
--numkarts=4
--difficulty=1
--seed=1
--log=1
